P27 wiring: the declared-tier share gate takes all four crossings through ONE tighten predicate (ShareBoundary over tightenShare): node repo share, browser repo share, the bulb and HTTP /cas faces, and the island CAS floor. The CAS audience reads off the asking island's relation (daemon island in-process, pool wiki island its plane, herm shore and HTTP world); an unreadable relation refuses by name. Groundwork (secrets registry, the predicate) carried from the parked secrets-store lane; the operator's vault commits stay there.

Local: 42/42 node+mesh files alone in bwrap; 9 browser-runner files ride CI. Sol read and blind Opus read before land.

